#: secure-login-collector.php
msgid "Secure Login Collector"
msgstr "Secure Login Collector"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: secure-login-collector.php
msgid "https://wp-mike.com"
msgstr "https://wp-mike.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: secure-login-collector.php
msgid ""
"Securely collects and stores encrypted login credentials from clients via "
"frontend form with email notifications."
msgstr "Sammelt und speichert verschlüsselte Login-Daten von Kunden sicher über ein Frontend-Formular mit E-Mail-Benachrichtigungen."

